---
import MotionBox from "@/components/ui/MotionBox";
import { COLORS } from "@/lib/colors";
---

<section>
  <MotionBox client:load style={{ backgroundColor: COLORS.teal, rotate: "-1.2deg" }} className="inline-block px-2 py-1 my-2">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">About</h2>
  </MotionBox>
  <p class="mb-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-secondary">
    I'm an 18-year-old programming and gaming enthusiast currently studying
    software engineering at a technical high school in Poznań, Poland, with a
    strong focus on solving complex problems. I am eager to develop new skills,
    particularly in the field of AI, and in my free time, I listen to music,
    play video games and keep up with the latest developments in programming and
    software engineering.
  </p>
</section>
